    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the labor law and the general municipal law, in relation to reciprocity of debarments imposed under the federal Davis-Bacon Act; and relating to a work group to study and make recommendations to the legislature regarding the appropriate payment of supplements to construction workers; and providing for the repeal of certain provisions of such laws relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S6790",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6790-2017",
